    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and conquer the post-apocalyptic world of Burntime.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Gameplay: Play through the original game from 1993 with some enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: Find food, parts to build traps and people to help you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer: Establish camps around all major cities to win the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remastered Visuals: Enjoy enhanced graphics and wide screen support while still being true to its 90s pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remaster Toggles: Prefer the original graphics, or the AMIGA sound track? Change in the options.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This remaster was done by a super fan of the original game.<br>It was only possible thanks to the ok by the creators, and the many issue feedback by fellow fans.<br> <br>It is fully reprogrammed from scratch using the original graphics and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Issue reports and smaller improvement ideas are appreciated on GitHub.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and conquer the post-apocalyptic world of Burntime.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Gameplay: Play through the original game from 1993 with some enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: Find food, parts to build traps and people to help you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer: Establish camps around all major cities to win the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remastered Visuals: Enjoy enhanced graphics and wide screen support while still being true to its 90s pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remaster Toggles: Prefer the original graphics, or the AMIGA sound track? Change in the options.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This remaster was done by a super fan of the original game.<br>It was only possible thanks to the ok by the creators, and the many issue feedback by fellow fans.<br> <br>It is fully reprogrammed from scratch using the original graphics and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Issue reports and smaller improvement ideas are appreciated on GitHub.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Burntime is a remaster and expansion of Max Design's post-apocalyptic strategy game 'Burntime' from 1993. It includes improvements like doubled resolution and wide screen support.",
